[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":1182},["ShallowReactive",2],{"content:\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-macos-environment-setup":3,"surround:\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-macos-environment-setup":1171},{"id":4,"title":5,"body":6,"categories":1147,"date":1149,"description":1150,"draft":1151,"extension":1152,"image":1153,"meta":1154,"navigation":1156,"path":1157,"permalink":1153,"published":1153,"readingTime":1158,"recommend":1153,"references":1153,"seo":1163,"sitemap":1164,"stem":1165,"tags":1166,"type":1169,"updated":1149,"__hash__":1170},"content\u002Fposts\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-macos-environment-setup.md","macOS 搭建 Flutter Android 与 iOS 开发环境",{"type":7,"value":8,"toc":1117},"minimark",[9,18,21,26,29,85,93,96,131,134,144,147,151,155,158,166,169,172,182,185,191,195,198,206,209,219,222,228,231,242,248,259,265,268,274,280,284,293,300,303,309,312,315,321,328,334,337,341,344,350,353,359,362,368,375,379,382,388,391,397,400,405,409,413,416,422,425,428,432,435,441,444,450,457,463,477,480,513,516,519,523,526,532,535,541,544,550,557,567,576,579,584,587,593,597,599,605,608,627,638,641,647,650,654,658,663,669,672,675,681,684,687,693,696,702,705,708,714,718,721,724,730,733,739,742,748,751,756,762,766,769,828,831,834,837,843,849,852,858,864,869,871,877,880,884,887,894,897,921,924,930,933,939,942,945,953,956,962,965,969,972,978,981,987,990,995,998,1004,1007,1013,1016,1022,1025,1028,1033,1036,1042,1045,1056,1059,1062],[10,11,12,13,17],"p",{},"搭建 Flutter 开发环境不只是下载 Flutter SDK，还需要根据目标平台安装 Android SDK、Xcode、CocoaPods、模拟器等原生工具。第一次执行 ",[14,15,16],"code",{"code":16},"flutter doctor","，通常会看到 Android SDK、Xcode、CocoaPods 或代理相关的警告。",[10,19,20],{},"本文记录在 Apple Silicon Mac 上补齐 Flutter Android、iOS 和 Web 开发环境的完整过程。",[22,23,25],"h2",{"id":24},"flutter-各平台依赖关系","Flutter 各平台依赖关系",[10,27,28],{},"Flutter 项目的 Dart 代码可以使用 Android Studio、VS Code、Cursor 等编辑器编写，但不同目标平台仍然需要各自的原生工具链。",[30,31,32,48],"table",{},[33,34,35],"thead",{},[36,37,38,42,45],"tr",{},[39,40,41],"th",{},"目标平台",[39,43,44],{},"必需工具",[39,46,47],{},"主要作用",[49,50,51,63,74],"tbody",{},[36,52,53,57,60],{},[54,55,56],"td",{},"Android",[54,58,59],{},"Android Studio、Android SDK",[54,61,62],{},"编译、打包、模拟器和真机调试",[36,64,65,68,71],{},[54,66,67],{},"iOS\u002FmacOS",[54,69,70],{},"Xcode、CocoaPods",[54,72,73],{},"iOS SDK、模拟器、签名和原生插件依赖",[36,75,76,79,82],{},[54,77,78],{},"Web",[54,80,81],{},"Chrome",[54,83,84],{},"Web 调试和运行",[86,87,90],"alert",{"title":88,"type":89},"先确定目标平台","info",[10,91,92],{},"只开发 Android 或 Web 时，可以暂时不安装完整 Xcode 和 CocoaPods；只有需要构建 iOS\u002FmacOS 应用时才需要补齐苹果工具链。",[10,94,95],{},"整个环境搭建顺序如下：",[97,98,99,102,109,112,115,118,121,124],"timeline",{},[10,100,101],{},"{1. Flutter SDK}",[10,103,104,105,108],{},"下载 SDK、配置 ",[14,106,107],{"code":107},"PATH","，确认 Flutter 命令可用。",[10,110,111],{},"{2. Android 工具链}",[10,113,114],{},"安装 Android Studio、SDK、许可证和 ARM64 模拟器。",[10,116,117],{},"{3. iOS\u002FmacOS 工具链}",[10,119,120],{},"安装完整 Xcode、Simulator Runtime 和 CocoaPods。",[10,122,123],{},"{4. 环境验收}",[10,125,126,127,130],{},"通过 ",[14,128,129],{"code":129},"flutter doctor -v"," 检查，并运行一个示例项目。",[10,132,133],{},"项目中的目录关系如下：",[135,136,142],"pre",{"className":137,"code":139,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"language-text","Flutter 项目\n├── android\u002F  → Android Studio、Android SDK\n├── ios\u002F      → Xcode、CocoaPods\n├── macos\u002F    → Xcode、CocoaPods\n├── web\u002F      → Chrome\n└── lib\u002F      → 多个平台共享的 Dart 代码\n","text","",[14,143,139],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,145,146],{},"iOS 应用只能在 macOS 上通过 Xcode 编译。平时仍然可以在 VS Code 或 Android Studio 中编写 Flutter 代码，只有配置签名、Capabilities 或修改原生 Swift 代码时才需要打开 Xcode。",[22,148,150],{"id":149},"安装-flutter-sdk","安装 Flutter SDK",[152,153,154],"h3",{"id":154},"安装基础命令行工具",[10,156,157],{},"Flutter 在 macOS 上依赖 Git 等基础命令行工具。执行：",[135,159,164],{"className":160,"code":162,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"language-bash","xcode-select --install\n","bash",[14,165,162],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,167,168],{},"系统会弹出 Command Line Tools 安装窗口，按提示完成安装。",[10,170,171],{},"这里安装的是轻量的 Xcode 命令行工具，足以支持 Flutter SDK 和 Git。后面如果需要编译 iOS 或 macOS 应用，仍然要安装完整 Xcode。",[86,173,176],{"title":174,"type":175},"Command Line Tools 不等于完整 Xcode","warning",[10,177,178,181],{},[14,179,180],{"code":180},"xcode-select --install"," 只能安装基础命令行工具。它不能提供完整的 iOS SDK、模拟器和签名能力。",[10,183,184],{},"检查 Git：",[135,186,189],{"className":187,"code":188,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"git --version\n",[14,190,188],{"__ignoreMap":141},[152,192,194],{"id":193},"下载-flutter-sdk","下载 Flutter SDK",[10,196,197],{},"打开 Flutter 官方手动安装页面：",[10,199,200],{},[201,202,203],"a",{"href":203,"rel":204},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.flutter.dev\u002Finstall\u002Fmanual",[205],"nofollow",[10,207,208],{},"根据 Mac 芯片选择正确的安装包：",[210,211,212,216],"ul",{},[213,214,215],"li",{},"M1、M2、M3、M4 等 Apple 芯片：选择 Apple Silicon（ARM64）。",[213,217,218],{},"Intel 芯片：选择 Intel（x64）。",[10,220,221],{},"可以通过下面的位置查看芯片类型：",[135,223,226],{"className":224,"code":225,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"系统设置 → 通用 → 关于本机 → 芯片\n",[14,227,225],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,229,230],{},"本文使用 Apple Silicon Mac，因此下载 ARM64 的 stable 稳定版 SDK。",[10,232,233,234,237,238,241],{},"不建议直接将 Flutter SDK 放在 ",[14,235,236],{"code":236},"Downloads","、",[14,239,240],{"code":240},"Desktop"," 或带空格、特殊字符的目录中。可以创建专门的开发工具目录：",[135,243,246],{"className":244,"code":245,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"mkdir -p \"$HOME\u002Fdevelop\"\n",[14,247,245],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,249,250,251,254,255,258],{},"假设安装包已经下载到 ",[14,252,253],{"code":253},"~\u002FDownloads","，解压到 ",[14,256,257],{"code":257},"~\u002Fdevelop","：",[135,260,263],{"className":261,"code":262,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"unzip ~\u002FDownloads\u002Fflutter_macos_*-stable.zip -d \"$HOME\u002Fdevelop\"\n",[14,264,262],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,266,267],{},"解压后的目录结构类似：",[135,269,272],{"className":270,"code":271,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"~\u002Fdevelop\u002Fflutter\n├── bin\n├── packages\n└── examples\n",[14,273,271],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,275,276,277,279],{},"如果 ",[14,278,236],{"code":236}," 中存在多个 Flutter 压缩包，建议先删除旧版本，或者将命令中的通配符替换为实际文件名，避免一次解压多个文件。",[152,281,283],{"id":282},"配置-path","配置 PATH",[10,285,286,287,290,291,258],{},"macOS 默认使用 Zsh。将 Flutter 的 ",[14,288,289],{"code":289},"bin"," 目录加入 ",[14,292,107],{"code":107},[135,294,298],{"className":295,"code":296,"filename":297,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"echo 'export PATH=\"$HOME\u002Fdevelop\u002Fflutter\u002Fbin:$PATH\"' >> ~\u002F.zprofile\n","~\u002F.zprofile",[14,299,296],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,301,302],{},"重新加载配置：",[135,304,307],{"className":305,"code":306,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"source ~\u002F.zprofile\n",[14,308,306],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,310,311],{},"也可以关闭并重新打开终端。",[10,313,314],{},"验证命令路径：",[135,316,319],{"className":317,"code":318,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"which flutter\nflutter --version\n",[14,320,318],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,322,323,324,327],{},"正常情况下，",[14,325,326],{"code":326},"which flutter"," 会输出：",[135,329,332],{"className":330,"code":331,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"\u002FUsers\u002F你的用户名\u002Fdevelop\u002Fflutter\u002Fbin\u002Fflutter\n",[14,333,331],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,335,336],{},"第一次执行 Flutter 命令时会下载 Dart SDK 和部分缓存文件，需要等待一段时间。",[152,338,340],{"id":339},"切换和升级-flutter-版本","切换和升级 Flutter 版本",[10,342,343],{},"查看当前发布渠道：",[135,345,348],{"className":346,"code":347,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter channel\n",[14,349,347],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,351,352],{},"个人学习和普通项目建议使用稳定版：",[135,354,357],{"className":355,"code":356,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter channel stable\nflutter upgrade\n",[14,358,356],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,360,361],{},"安装完成后执行一次全面检查：",[135,363,366],{"className":364,"code":365,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter doctor -v\n",[14,367,365],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,369,370,371,374],{},"此时 Flutter 本体应显示 ",[14,372,373],{"code":373},"[✓]","。Android 或 iOS 工具链出现警告属于正常情况，继续按照后面的步骤补齐即可。",[22,376,378],{"id":377},"检查-flutter-sdk","检查 Flutter SDK",[10,380,381],{},"先确认 Flutter 命令可以正常使用：",[135,383,386],{"className":384,"code":385,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter --version\nflutter doctor -v\n",[14,387,385],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,389,390],{},"例如：",[135,392,395],{"className":393,"code":394,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"[✓] Flutter\n[✗] Android toolchain - develop for Android devices\n[!] Xcode - develop for iOS and macOS\n[✓] Chrome - develop for the web\n[✓] Connected device\n[✓] Network resources\n",[14,396,394],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,398,399],{},"这表示 Flutter SDK 和 Web 环境已经可用，但 Android 与 iOS 的原生工具链还没有配置完整。",[10,401,402,404],{},[14,403,16],{"code":16}," 是整个安装过程最重要的检查工具。每完成一个阶段，都可以重新运行一次确认结果。",[22,406,408],{"id":407},"配置-android-开发环境","配置 Android 开发环境",[152,410,412],{"id":411},"安装-android-studio","安装 Android Studio",[10,414,415],{},"下载并安装 Android Studio：",[10,417,418],{},[201,419,420],{"href":420,"rel":421},"https:\u002F\u002Fdeveloper.android.com\u002Fstudio",[205],[10,423,424],{},"第一次打开 Android Studio 时，安装向导会下载 Android SDK。这里显示的 Android SDK 许可协议只是开发工具使用协议，不会产生费用。",[10,426,427],{},"首次安装需要从 Google 下载数百 MB 甚至更多组件，国内网络环境可能耗时较长。只要下载进度仍然变化，就继续等待，不要直接关闭 Android Studio。",[152,429,431],{"id":430},"安装-android-sdk-组件","安装 Android SDK 组件",[10,433,434],{},"打开 Android Studio：",[135,436,439],{"className":437,"code":438,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"More Actions → SDK Manager\n",[14,440,438],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,442,443],{},"也可以在已打开项目的情况下进入：",[135,445,448],{"className":446,"code":447,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"Settings → Languages & Frameworks → Android SDK\n",[14,449,447],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,451,452,453,456],{},"在 ",[14,454,455],{"code":455},"SDK Platforms"," 中至少安装一个需要使用的 Android SDK Platform。",[10,458,452,459,462],{},[14,460,461],{"code":461},"SDK Tools"," 中确认安装：",[210,464,465,468,471,474],{},[213,466,467],{},"Android SDK Command-line Tools (latest)",[213,469,470],{},"Android SDK Platform-Tools",[213,472,473],{},"Android SDK Build-Tools",[213,475,476],{},"Android Emulator",[10,478,479],{},"各组件用途如下：",[210,481,482,492,502,508],{},[213,483,484,487,488,491],{},[14,485,486],{"code":486},"Command-line Tools","：提供 ",[14,489,490],{"code":490},"sdkmanager"," 等命令，执行 Android 许可证检查时必需。",[213,493,494,497,498,501],{},[14,495,496],{"code":496},"Platform-Tools","：包含 ",[14,499,500],{"code":500},"adb","，用于连接真机、安装应用和调试。",[213,503,504,507],{},[14,505,506],{"code":506},"Build-Tools","：用于编译、打包和签名 Android 应用。",[213,509,510,512],{},[14,511,476],{"code":476},"：用于运行 Android 虚拟设备。",[10,514,515],{},"普通 Flutter 项目暂时不需要安装 NDK 和 CMake。只有项目包含 C\u002FC++ 原生代码或某些插件明确要求时再安装。",[10,517,518],{},"Android Sources 主要用于阅读系统源码，不是编译 Flutter 项目的必需组件。如果下载速度太慢，可以先取消 Sources，只保留核心工具。",[152,520,522],{"id":521},"配置-android-sdk-路径","配置 Android SDK 路径",[10,524,525],{},"macOS 默认的 Android SDK 目录通常是：",[135,527,530],{"className":528,"code":529,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"\u002FUsers\u002F你的用户名\u002FLibrary\u002FAndroid\u002Fsdk\n",[14,531,529],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,533,534],{},"可以让 Flutter 显式使用这个目录：",[135,536,539],{"className":537,"code":538,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter config --android-sdk \"$HOME\u002FLibrary\u002FAndroid\u002Fsdk\"\n",[14,540,538],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,542,543],{},"接受 Android SDK 许可证：",[135,545,548],{"className":546,"code":547,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter doctor --android-licenses\n",[14,549,547],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,551,552,553,556],{},"出现协议询问时输入 ",[14,554,555],{"code":555},"y"," 接受。",[86,558,560],{"title":559},"许可证不会收费",[10,561,562,563,566],{},"Android SDK 安装和 ",[14,564,565],{"code":565},"flutter doctor --android-licenses"," 显示的是开发工具使用协议。接受这些协议不会产生费用。",[10,568,569,570,572,573,575],{},"如果提示找不到 ",[14,571,490],{"code":490},"，通常是没有安装 ",[14,574,467],{"code":467},"。返回 SDK Manager 补装后再执行即可。",[10,577,578],{},"最后检查：",[135,580,582],{"className":581,"code":365,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],[14,583,365],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,585,586],{},"出现下面的结果，说明 Android 工具链已经配置成功：",[135,588,591],{"className":589,"code":590,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"[✓] Android toolchain - develop for Android devices\n",[14,592,590],{"__ignoreMap":141},[22,594,596],{"id":595},"创建-android-模拟器","创建 Android 模拟器",[10,598,434],{},[135,600,603],{"className":601,"code":602,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"More Actions → Virtual Device Manager\n",[14,604,602],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,606,607],{},"然后按以下步骤创建模拟器：",[609,610,611,618,621,624],"ol",{},[213,612,613,614,617],{},"点击 ",[14,615,616],{"code":616},"+"," 创建虚拟设备。",[213,619,620],{},"选择 Pixel 等常用机型。",[213,622,623],{},"下载并选择 Android 系统镜像。",[213,625,626],{},"完成创建并点击启动按钮。",[10,628,629,630,633,634,637],{},"Apple Silicon Mac 应优先选择 ",[14,631,632],{"code":632},"ARM64"," 或 ",[14,635,636],{"code":636},"arm64-v8a"," 系统镜像。使用与 CPU 架构一致的镜像，启动速度和运行效率通常更好。",[10,639,640],{},"查看 Flutter 已识别的设备：",[135,642,645],{"className":643,"code":644,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter devices\n",[14,646,644],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,648,649],{},"也可以连接 Android 真机。需要在手机的开发者选项中开启 USB 调试，并在首次连接时允许当前电脑进行调试。",[22,651,653],{"id":652},"配置-ios-和-macos-开发环境","配置 iOS 和 macOS 开发环境",[152,655,657],{"id":656},"安装完整-xcode","安装完整 Xcode",[10,659,276,660,662],{},[14,661,16],{"code":16}," 显示：",[135,664,667],{"className":665,"code":666,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"Xcode installation is incomplete; a full installation is necessary\n",[14,668,666],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,670,671],{},"说明当前可能只有 Xcode Command Line Tools，或者 Xcode 尚未完成初始化。开发 iOS 和 macOS 应用需要安装完整 Xcode。",[10,673,674],{},"可以直接在 Mac App Store 搜索并安装 Xcode，也可以从 Apple Developer 网站下载：",[10,676,677],{},[201,678,679],{"href":679,"rel":680},"https:\u002F\u002Fdeveloper.apple.com\u002Fxcode\u002F",[205],[10,682,683],{},"Xcode 本身免费。安装包和模拟器运行时占用空间较大，建议提前预留 30～50 GB 磁盘空间。",[10,685,686],{},"安装完成后先手动打开 Xcode 一次，接受协议并等待附加组件安装完成，然后执行：",[135,688,691],{"className":689,"code":690,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"sudo xcode-select --switch \u002FApplications\u002FXcode.app\u002FContents\u002FDeveloper\nsudo xcodebuild -runFirstLaunch\nsudo xcodebuild -license accept\n",[14,692,690],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,694,695],{},"如果需要 iOS 模拟器，可以在 Xcode 中打开：",[135,697,700],{"className":698,"code":699,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"Xcode → Settings → Components\n",[14,701,699],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,703,704],{},"下载需要使用的 iOS Simulator Runtime。",[10,706,707],{},"启动模拟器：",[135,709,712],{"className":710,"code":711,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"open -a Simulator\n",[14,713,711],{"__ignoreMap":141},[152,715,717],{"id":716},"安装-cocoapods","安装 CocoaPods",[10,719,720],{},"CocoaPods 用于管理 Flutter 插件依赖的 iOS\u002FmacOS 原生库。没有 CocoaPods 时，部分插件无法在 iOS 或 macOS 上编译。",[10,722,723],{},"通过 Homebrew 安装：",[135,725,728],{"className":726,"code":727,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"brew install cocoapods\n",[14,729,727],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,731,732],{},"检查版本：",[135,734,737],{"className":735,"code":736,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"pod --version\n",[14,738,736],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,740,741],{},"必要时初始化本地 Specs 仓库：",[135,743,746],{"className":744,"code":745,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"pod setup\n",[14,747,745],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,749,750],{},"再次检查 Flutter 环境：",[135,752,754],{"className":753,"code":365,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],[14,755,365],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,757,758,759,761],{},"当 Xcode 一项变成 ",[14,760,373],{"code":373},"，iOS 与 macOS 的基础开发环境就配置完成了。",[22,763,765],{"id":764},"xcode-和-apple-开发者账号是否收费","Xcode 和 Apple 开发者账号是否收费",[10,767,768],{},"Xcode、iOS 模拟器和本地开发都是免费的。是否收费主要取决于应用是否需要正式分发。",[30,770,771,781],{},[33,772,773],{},[36,774,775,778],{},[39,776,777],{},"使用场景",[39,779,780],{},"免费 Apple 账号",[49,782,783,791,798,806,814,821],{},[36,784,785,788],{},[54,786,787],{},"学习 Flutter\u002FiOS",[54,789,790],{},"可以",[36,792,793,796],{},[54,794,795],{},"使用 iOS 模拟器",[54,797,790],{},[36,799,800,803],{},[54,801,802],{},"在自己的 iPhone 上真机调试",[54,804,805],{},"可以，但签名有效期和数量有限制",[36,807,808,811],{},[54,809,810],{},"发布到 App Store",[54,812,813],{},"不可以",[36,815,816,819],{},[54,817,818],{},"使用 TestFlight 分发",[54,820,813],{},[36,822,823,826],{},[54,824,825],{},"正式证书和长期分发",[54,827,813],{},[10,829,830],{},"发布 App Store 或使用 TestFlight，需要加入 Apple Developer Program。苹果通常按年收取会员费，具体价格以 Apple Developer 官方页面显示为准。",[10,832,833],{},"如果目前只学习 Flutter 或在自己的设备上调试，不需要立即付费。",[22,835,836],{"id":836},"处理代理警告",[10,838,839,840,842],{},"开启 Clash、V2Ray 等代理软件后，",[14,841,16],{"code":16}," 可能提示：",[135,844,847],{"className":845,"code":846,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"[!] Proxy Configuration\n    ! NO_PROXY is not set\n",[14,848,846],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,850,851],{},"可以将本地地址排除在代理之外：",[135,853,856],{"className":854,"code":855,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"export NO_PROXY=\"localhost,127.0.0.1,::1\"\nexport no_proxy=\"$NO_PROXY\"\n",[14,857,855],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,859,860,861,258],{},"需要永久生效时，将配置加入 ",[14,862,863],{"code":863},"~\u002F.zshrc",[135,865,867],{"className":866,"code":855,"filename":863,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],[14,868,855],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,870,302],{},[135,872,875],{"className":873,"code":874,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"source ~\u002F.zshrc\n",[14,876,874],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,878,879],{},"如果 Flutter 依赖可以正常下载，这个警告一般不会阻止开发，也可以暂时忽略。",[22,881,883],{"id":882},"app-store-无法下载-xcode","App Store 无法下载 Xcode",[10,885,886],{},"如果 App Store 可以打开 Xcode 页面，但点击“获取”时提示无法建立安全连接，通常与系统代理或代理节点的 TLS 处理有关。",[86,888,891],{"title":889,"type":890},"优先检查系统代理","error",[10,892,893],{},"App Store 的下载页面可能可以正常访问，但“获取”接口的 TLS 校验更严格。代理节点或 HTTPS 检查可能导致安全连接失败。",[10,895,896],{},"可以按以下顺序排查：",[609,898,899,906,909,912,915,918],{},[213,900,901,902,905],{},"使用 ",[14,903,904],{"code":904},"Command + Q"," 完全退出 App Store。",[213,907,908],{},"暂时关闭代理软件的系统代理，或者直接退出代理软件。",[213,910,911],{},"重新打开 App Store 并再次点击获取。",[213,913,914],{},"如果仍然失败，切换到手机热点重试。",[213,916,917],{},"检查系统是否开启自动设置日期和时间。",[213,919,920],{},"退出 App Store 的 Apple ID 后重新登录。",[10,922,923],{},"如果必须使用代理，可以考虑让 Apple 相关域名直连：",[135,925,928],{"className":926,"code":927,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"*.apple.com\n*.apps.apple.com\n*.itunes.apple.com\n*.icloud.com\n*.mzstatic.com\n",[14,929,927],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,931,932],{},"也可以绕过 App Store，从 Apple Developer Downloads 下载 Xcode：",[10,934,935],{},[201,936,937],{"href":937,"rel":938},"https:\u002F\u002Fdeveloper.apple.com\u002Fdownload\u002Fall\u002F",[205],[22,940,941],{"id":941},"配置编辑器",[10,943,944],{},"Android Studio 用户可以在插件市场安装：",[210,946,947,950],{},[213,948,949],{},"Flutter",[213,951,952],{},"Dart",[10,954,955],{},"VS Code 用户可以安装官方 Flutter 扩展，Dart 扩展会作为依赖一同安装：",[10,957,958],{},[201,959,960],{"href":960,"rel":961},"https:\u002F\u002Fmarketplace.visualstudio.com\u002Fitems?itemName=Dart-Code.flutter",[205],[10,963,964],{},"编辑器只是代码编写入口。即使使用 VS Code，构建 Android 仍然需要 Android SDK，构建 iOS 仍然需要 Xcode。",[22,966,968],{"id":967},"创建并运行-flutter-项目","创建并运行 Flutter 项目",[10,970,971],{},"创建新项目：",[135,973,976],{"className":974,"code":975,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter create flutter_demo\ncd flutter_demo\n",[14,977,975],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,979,980],{},"安装依赖：",[135,982,985],{"className":983,"code":984,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter pub get\n",[14,986,984],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,988,989],{},"查看设备：",[135,991,993],{"className":992,"code":644,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],[14,994,644],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,996,997],{},"运行项目：",[135,999,1002],{"className":1000,"code":1001,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter run\n",[14,1003,1001],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,1005,1006],{},"设备较多时，可以通过设备 ID 指定目标：",[135,1008,1011],{"className":1009,"code":1010,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"flutter run -d 设备ID\n",[14,1012,1010],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,1014,1015],{},"常见目标包括：",[135,1017,1020],{"className":1018,"code":1019,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],"# Chrome\nflutter run -d chrome\n\n# macOS 桌面端\nflutter run -d macos\n",[14,1021,1019],{"__ignoreMap":141},[22,1023,1024],{"id":1024},"最终检查",[10,1026,1027],{},"完整环境可以使用下面的命令验收：",[135,1029,1031],{"className":1030,"code":365,"language":163,"meta":141},[161],[14,1032,365],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,1034,1035],{},"目标结果如下：",[135,1037,1040],{"className":1038,"code":1039,"language":140,"meta":141},[138],"[✓] Flutter\n[✓] Android toolchain\n[✓] Xcode\n[✓] Chrome\n[✓] Connected device\n[✓] Network resources\n",[14,1041,1039],{"__ignoreMap":141},[10,1043,1044],{},"不必为了所有勾选项一次性安装全部工具：",[210,1046,1047,1050,1053],{},[213,1048,1049],{},"只开发 Android：Android toolchain 变绿后即可开始。",[213,1051,1052],{},"只开发 Web：Flutter 和 Chrome 正常即可。",[213,1054,1055],{},"开发 iOS\u002FmacOS：必须补齐完整 Xcode 和 CocoaPods。",[10,1057,1058],{},"根据实际目标平台安装依赖，可以减少磁盘占用和不必要的配置工作。",[22,1060,1061],{"id":1061},"参考资料",[210,1063,1064,1070,1077,1084,1091,1098,1104,1110],{},[213,1065,1066,1067],{},"Flutter SDK 手动安装：",[201,1068,203],{"href":203,"rel":1069},[205],[213,1071,1072,1073],{},"Flutter Android 环境配置：",[201,1074,1075],{"href":1075,"rel":1076},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.flutter.dev\u002Fplatform-integration\u002Fandroid\u002Fsetup",[205],[213,1078,1079,1080],{},"Flutter iOS 环境配置：",[201,1081,1082],{"href":1082,"rel":1083},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.flutter.dev\u002Fplatform-integration\u002Fios\u002Fsetup",[205],[213,1085,1086,1087],{},"Flutter Android Studio 配置：",[201,1088,1089],{"href":1089,"rel":1090},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.flutter.dev\u002Ftools\u002Fandroid-studio",[205],[213,1092,1093,1094],{},"Flutter VS Code 配置：",[201,1095,1096],{"href":1096,"rel":1097},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.flutter.dev\u002Ftools\u002Fvs-code",[205],[213,1099,1100,1101],{},"Android Studio：",[201,1102,420],{"href":420,"rel":1103},[205],[213,1105,1106,1107],{},"Xcode：",[201,1108,679],{"href":679,"rel":1109},[205],[213,1111,1112,1113],{},"CocoaPods：",[201,1114,1115],{"href":1115,"rel":1116},"https:\u002F\u002Fguides.cocoapods.org\u002Fusing\u002Fgetting-started.html",[205],{"title":141,"searchDepth":1118,"depth":1118,"links":1119},4,[1120,1122,1129,1130,1135,1136,1140,1141,1142,1143,1144,1145,1146],{"id":24,"depth":1121,"text":25},2,{"id":149,"depth":1121,"text":150,"children":1123},[1124,1126,1127,1128],{"id":154,"depth":1125,"text":154},3,{"id":193,"depth":1125,"text":194},{"id":282,"depth":1125,"text":283},{"id":339,"depth":1125,"text":340},{"id":377,"depth":1121,"text":378},{"id":407,"depth":1121,"text":408,"children":1131},[1132,1133,1134],{"id":411,"depth":1125,"text":412},{"id":430,"depth":1125,"text":431},{"id":521,"depth":1125,"text":522},{"id":595,"depth":1121,"text":596},{"id":652,"depth":1121,"text":653,"children":1137},[1138,1139],{"id":656,"depth":1125,"text":657},{"id":716,"depth":1125,"text":717},{"id":764,"depth":1121,"text":765},{"id":836,"depth":1121,"text":836},{"id":882,"depth":1121,"text":883},{"id":941,"depth":1121,"text":941},{"id":967,"depth":1121,"text":968},{"id":1024,"depth":1121,"text":1024},{"id":1061,"depth":1121,"text":1061},[1148],"移动开发","2026-08-02","记录在 Apple Silicon Mac 上搭建 Flutter 开发环境的完整过程，包括 Android Studio、Android SDK、模拟器、Xcode、CocoaPods、代理配置以及 flutter doctor 常见问题。",false,"md",null,{"slots":1155},{},true,"\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-macos-environment-setup",{"text":1159,"minutes":1160,"time":1161,"words":1162},"14 min read",13.925,835500,2785,{"title":5,"description":1150},{"loc":1157},"posts\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-macos-environment-setup",[949,56,1167,1168],"iOS","macOS","tech","wic49uTQrfq_y2lTcuOQ-FxQ0f35ebJCbW35GWF1F0M",[1172,1177],{"title":1173,"path":1174,"stem":1175,"date":1176,"type":1169,"children":-1},"使用 Fluent Bit 将 Kubernetes 日志采集到 ELK","\u002F2026\u002F07\u002Fk8s-logs-to-elk-with-fluent-bit","posts\u002F2026\u002F07\u002Fk8s-logs-to-elk-with-fluent-bit","2026-07-29",{"title":1178,"path":1179,"stem":1180,"date":1181,"type":1169,"children":-1},"macOS 使用华为手机调试 Flutter：ADB 设备为空排查","\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-huawei-usb-device-debugging","posts\u002F2026\u002F08\u002Fflutter-huawei-usb-device-debugging","2026-08-04",1786037977958]